逼得我快速吸了幾口麵，再夾起一塊梅花肉，依舊裹著辣醬放入口中，嚼著那瘦肉滿滿的肉感混合著辣醬的香與辣，吞下後再配一杯冰開水，簡直是冰火兩重天，加上麵吃到飽，不用怕沒有麵可以配肉\n當加入第二碗麵的時候，一開始的蒜末跟辣醬已跟麵湯融合，自己主動變味，稍待片刻便可繼續大快朵頤\n\n明太子叉燒飯是每日限量的，在叉燒飯原有的基礎上在鋪蓋了一層的炙燒明太子醬，一口下去鹹香微辣在口中不停交替，仔細咀嚼可以咬著明太子顆粒玩，好吃是好吃，但是量太少\n\n推薦可以吃小辣的人點蒜辣豚骨拉麵，明太子叉燒飯必點",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14814920011973008507/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzYjJGRVozcFphMnhRVFZWU1NGSXdjRXBOTVZKV1ZtcGthazB5WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,787,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psb2FEZ3pZa2xQTVVSSFIwcEpNMVJWVmpkak0yYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x79e98b630ae17cf3!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjloaDgzYklPMURHR0pJM1RVVjdjM2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psb2FEZ3pZa2xQTVVSSFIwcEpNMVJWVmpkak0yYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psb2FEZ3pZa2xQTVVSSFIwcEpNMVJWVmpkak0yYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psb2FEZ3pZa2xQTVVSSFIwcEpNMVJWVmpkak0y